    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/28/Ikaruga_Queen%27s_Blade_ULB_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240826235552\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Ikaruga Queen&#39;s Blade ULB \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/28/Ikaruga_Queen%27s_Blade_ULB_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240826235552\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"935\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Ikaruga Queen&#39;s Blade ULB .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Ikaruga_Queen%27s_Blade_ULB_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><br />\n<b>凤凰联合忍者</b>\n</p><p><b>Ikaruga</b>  是来自《闪乱神乐》电子游戏系列的角色。她在《闪乱神乐：少女的肖像》中首次登场。\n\n</p><p>她在日语版中由今井麻美配音，英语版中由亚历克西斯·蒂普顿配音。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">外观</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIkaruga%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Ikaruga</b>  是一位优雅的女孩，黑色长发，刘海平直贴在额头。在常服中，她身穿白色镶金边夹克，有六个扣子和一些流苏。左臂上有半藏学校臂章。她穿着金色镶边的白色裙子和与夹克配色相似的靴子，里面穿着黑色紧身裤。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">性格</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIkaruga%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Ikaruga</b>  担任女子忍者队队长的责任。她通常冷静，但会被  <b>Katsuragi</b>的好色之举激怒。像  <b>Katsuragi</b>, <b>Ikaruga</b>  用冷酷的外表隐藏悲伤的过去。但在忍者同伴们的爱下，她的痛苦得到缓解，她也变得更加开放。她喜欢烹饪，享受传统日式料理，甚至会自己做菜。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/96/Ikaruga_S_Queen%27s_Blade_ULB_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240826235653\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Ikaruga S Queen&#39;s Blade ULB \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/96/Ikaruga_S_Queen%27s_Blade_ULB_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240826235653\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1037\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Ikaruga S Queen&#39;s Blade ULB .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Ikaruga_S_Queen%27s_Blade_ULB_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f7/Ikaruga_Phoenix_Conglomerate_Ninja_Master_of_Kouma_Clan_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250626000917\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Ikaruga Phoenix Conglomerate Ninja Master of Kouma Clan Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f7/Ikaruga_Phoenix_Conglomerate_Ninja_Master_of_Kouma_Clan_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250626000917\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"867\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Ikaruga Phoenix Conglomerate Ninja Master of Kouma Clan Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Ikaruga_Phoenix_Conglomerate_Ninja_Master_of_Kouma_Clan_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260819222625\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39741-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260819222625 and revision id 64078. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
